<article class="env-lemma" id="063K">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/063K">Lemma <span data-tag="063K">31.22.2</span>.</a> Let $i : Z \to X$ be an immersion of schemes. We have the following implications: $i$ is regular $\Rightarrow $ $i$ is Koszul-regular $\Rightarrow $ $i$ is $H_1$-regular $\Rightarrow $ $i$ is quasi-regular. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      The lemma immediately reduces to Lemma <a href="/tag/063E" data-tag="063E">31.21.3</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>